    { "a": "Categorical", "t": "baseline", "aka": ["category", "categories", "qualitative", "factor", "factors", "enum", "discrete categories", "categorical variables"], "q": "Values from a fixed set of groups. Models need one-hot or target encoding, or embeddings, to use it." }
